Assumptions: ten weeks to a manuscript, one researcher, existing hardware, no collaborator assumed; $5k excludes salary and publication charges. Scientific publication temporarily defers Neo’s internal-programming and investor-demo conditions. D1 found **no fabricated citations** in its scope; its overstated and correction-affected claims receive no weight.

